<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002S_S000E" variety="S000E">
<name>Vehicle Surroundings Monitor</name>
<ttl id="1002S_S000E_746W2_T00DG" variety="T00DG">
<name>Back Guide Monitor System</name>
<para id="RM00000303O01GX" category="C" type-id="803MO" name-id="672RD-14" from="200912">
<dtccode>U0126</dtccode>
<dtcname>Steering Sensor Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000303O01GX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HYB00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This DTC is output when a malfunction occurs in the CAN communication system connected to the navigation receiver assembly.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>When a CAN communication system malfunction DTC is output, other systems may also output CAN communication system malfunction DTCs.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U0126</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>CAN reception malfunction (from steering angle sensor)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>CAN Communication System</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000303O01GX_02" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000303O01GX_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000303O01GX_03_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HYC00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the screen display and record the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OCQ05NX"/>)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" on the screen to clear the data. </ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Start the engine, check the DTCs again, and proceed to the following destination.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTCs are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No DTC Output (Normal)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When a CAN communication system malfunction DTC is output, other systems may also output CAN communication system malfunction DTCs.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the inspection and repair of the CAN communication system have been completed in another system, the DTC will no longer be output after rechecking.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the DTC is output frequently, even if it is not output after rechecking, simulate the problem symptom and inspect again. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000ABY07EX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000303O01GX_03_0006" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000303O01GX_03_0007" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000303O01GX_03_0006">
<testtitle>Go to CAN Communication System<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001R4W019X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000303O01GX_03_0007">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>